# Settings' texts that reach kl_tr through a variable (tools/i18n/tr.py reads this with the source, WS158 p004).
# The pages' names and summaries (pages.c se_pages), drawn with kl_tr(page->name) and kl_tr(page->summary).
msg	Settings
msg	Change how Kei looks and works.
msg	Wi-Fi
msg	Join wireless networks and turn the radio on or off.
msg	Ethernet
msg	Wired connections and their addresses.
msg	Bluetooth
msg	Pair and connect wireless devices.
msg	VPN
msg	Connect securely to other networks.
msg	Network
msg	Manage connections and internet settings.
msg	Appearance
msg	The look of windows and the desktop.
msg	Wallpaper
msg	The picture behind your windows.
msg	Notifications
msg	Choose which applications may notify you.
msg	Sound
msg	Volume and the sound output.
msg	Display
msg	Arrange the displays and set the brightness.
msg	Languages
msg	The input method and the display language.
msg	Storage
msg	How the disks and folders are used, and the Trash.
msg	Power
msg	Sleep and the screen.
msg	Keyboard
msg	Key repeat and the layout.
msg	Mouse
msg	Pointer speed, acceleration and scrolling.
msg	Touchpad
msg	Printers
msg	Add and manage printers.
msg	Sharing
msg	Remote Login and, later, cloud storage.
msg	Users
msg	Accounts on this computer.
msg	Updates
msg	Keep Kei up to date.
msg	About
msg	This computer and the version of Kei.
# The search's header (search.c, a page of its own drawn by se_page_header).
msg	Search Results
# The input methods' choices on the Languages page (page-languages.c languages_choices).
msg	Japanese
msg	Kei's input method: romaji to kana, converted a phrase at a time.
msg	SKK
msg	Emacs's SKK: an upper-case letter starts a word, Space converts it.
msg	None (English)
msg	The keys type as they are; no input method.
# The Welcome's steps' headers and the keys it lists (welcome.c, ws164-p002), drawn with kl_tr through se_page_header and se_row_value.
msg	Connect to a network
msg	Join Wi-Fi now, or later in Settings.
msg	Your network
msg	The wired connection and its address.
msg	Choose your look
msg	A picture for the desktop, and how clear the windows are.
msg	Languages and input
msg	How you type, and the language of the desktop's words.
msg	Keys to know
msg	Kei is quick to use from the keyboard.
msg	You are all set
msg	Start using Kei opens Files at Today. The Welcome is in Settings > About whenever you want it again.
msg	Open App Home (tap the key)
msg	Wiseview: every window at a glance
msg	Switch between windows
msg	Lock the screen
msg	Move between desktops
msg	Switch the input language
